Homepage: https://vajra-os.org

Package: vajra-security-center
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, ufw, gnupg, apparmor
Recommends: clamav, fail2ban
Description: Vajra OS Security Center — firewall, encryption, audit, antivirus
 Centralized security management for Vajra OS. Provides a dashboard with
 security score, firewall management, file/disk encryption, access control
 (PAM/sudo/AppArmor), audit logging, and antivirus scanning.
 .
 Features:
  * Security dashboard with score (0-100)
  * UFW firewall management (allow/deny ports, services)
  * GPG file encryption/decryption
  * LUKS disk encryption status
  * AppArmor profile management
  * Failed login tracking
  * Audit log of all security events
  * One-click security hardening
  * ClamAV antivirus integration
